@baseUrl = http://localhost:4010
@token = tok_acme_admin

### the API is healthy after the Prisma cutover
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### the same product list, now backed by PostgreSQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2&sort=createdAt

### customers are stored in real rows with a tenant column
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/customers?limit=2&sort=createdAt

### a seeded order with a fixed ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/orders/ord_demo_pending

### a tenant cannot see another tenant's order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_globex/orders/ord_demo_pending
